                           Nekta's footprint spans all major metropolitan cities
                           across India, strategically positioned to serve the
                           dynamic needs of modern institutions. With central
                           kitchens located close to key airports, business
                           districts, and urban hubs—we are designed for
                           accessibility, agility, and scale.
                        </p>
                        <p class="copy-tight">
                           Built to meet the evolving demands of new-age
